full year of contributions from the US Gas Utilities in our Gas Distribution and Storage segment;

positive earnings impact in Enbridge Gas Ontario due to colder weather in 2025 compared to a negative impact in 2024, higher storage optimization and pricing, and higher distribution margin and customer growth in our Gas Distribution and Storage segment;

